      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just gone. the business, the house, the way people used to look at me... it's all just vanishing. i feel like i'm in a freefall and the worst part isn't even the money, it's knowing exactly how much i have to lose when i finally hit the ground. the humiliation is gonna be unbearable.",
